title Xử lý yêu cầu thanh toán trùng (Idempotency)

actor Frontend
participant "PaymentController" as Ctrl
participant "PaymentService" as PaySvc
database "Database / Cache" as DB

Frontend -> Ctrl : POST /payments (Header: Idempotency-Key = "uuid-123")
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> PaySvc : initiatePayment(..., "uuid-123")
activate PaySvc

PaySvc -> DB : findUnique({ idempotencyKey: "uuid-123" })
activate DB
DB --> PaySvc : Existing Payment Record (status: PROCESSING / SUCCEEDED)
deactivate DB

PaySvc -> PaySvc : Bỏ qua bước tạo mới, dùng record cũ
PaySvc --> Ctrl : existing payment record
deactivate PaySvc

Ctrl --> Frontend : 200 OK { data: existing payment details } (Thay vì 201 Created)
deactivate Ctrl

note right of Frontend
 Frontend nhận diện được trùng lặp,
 không bị trừ tiền hoặc sinh giao dịch rác.
end note
@enduml
